+# Host name entry (experimental)
+
+With `-reimsmetal -reimshostname`, publish `NativeMacMetal` as the Metal plug-in
+name. This requires the authored entry bundle in `/Library/GPUBundles` before
+boot. Without the second flag, the existing Apple paravirtual entry remains
+selected. The bundle changes display-name metadata only; resource, shader
+and command behavior stay in the existing driver. Signing and loader behavior
+must be checked by a cold boot before enabling the entry in a normal session.
